@startuml Model
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
title Model of OpenIMS

class User {
  Id
  Name
  PasswordHash
  EMailAddress
  UserIsActivated
  UserIsLocked
  RegistrationMoment
}

class Role {
  Id
  Name
}

class AccessToken {
  Value
  ExpiredMoment
}

class UserSetting {
  Key
  Value
}

class Setting {
  Key
  Value
}

User -right-> "*" Role : Roles
Role --> "*" Role : DirectlyInheritedRoles
User --> "*" AccessToken : AccessToken
User --> "*" UserSetting : Settings of this user

note as SettingNote
  A "Setting" applies to the whole installation,
  a "UserSetting" belongs to exactly one user.
end note
Setting .. SettingNote

@enduml
